From: StanleyYP Wang <StanleyYP.Wang@mediatek.com>
Date: Thu, 7 Jul 2022 11:09:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7915: eeprom bin file mode and cal-free data

EEPROM handling extensions: load the EEPROM image and pre-cal data
from a firmware-loader blob named by the bin_file_name device tree
property, merge per-die cal-free efuse bytes into the image, and
size the WTBL according to the mt7981 efuse variant.

Squash of the following MediaTek commits:
- wifi: mt76: mt7915: implement bin file mode
  (StanleyYP Wang, 2022-07-07)
- wifi: mt76: mt7915: add cal free data merge support
  (StanleyYP Wang, 2023-03-30)
- wifi: mt76: mt7915: add mt7981 efuse variants support
  (Henry Yen, 2023-12-11)
